            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Your connection with nature's spirits has progressed to the point where you can even have casual conversation with pebbles and boulders. You gain stone tell as a primal innate spell that you can cast once per day. You get a +2 circumstance bonus to Diplomacy checks to Gather Information from stones."
